{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sci-fi pathologist simulator. Identify aliens, detect damages, and perform autopsies to determine the cause of death. Choose to follow protocols or fulfill special requests when handling bodies and their stuff. Your choices may have global consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/564b9f0d1b22cd678e4b6e0cf7f3ea1f.avif?t=1754376091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/8eb868b25dd711e9cb49d521894baf25.poster.avif?t=1754376091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/8eb868b25dd711e9cb49d521894baf25.webm?t=1754376091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a pathologist for aliens in a sci-fi environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determine the real cause of death using tools for analysis</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/be371e39bde7e9a9fe4d82178264eb37.avif?t=1754376091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/e8e73becc47a07fd04f65ce90e4ebdaf.poster.avif?t=1754376091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885910/extras/e8e73becc47a07fd04f65ce90e4ebdaf.webm?t=1754376091\" type=\"video/webm; cod